    "name": "Masternoid",
    "steam_appid": 2843750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843750/extras/7314bb2c7ed4c63609d237b604b5c1df.poster.avif?t=1721339108\" width=605 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843750/extras/7314bb2c7ed4c63609d237b604b5c1df.webm?t=1721339108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Masternoid is a colorful arcade game for all ages that brings the timeless gameplay of old classics in the VR age, adding bombastic explosions and destructive power ups in the mix.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel through the voxel universe</strong></h2> Master the art of destruction and explore a universe of <strong>50+ meticulously designed handcrafted levels</strong>. Collect all the stars and move through the Masternoid world where a voxel surprise awaits at every corner. Compete with friends and rise through the ranks on the leaderboards as you hone your abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843750/extras/67ff580bcaf89795487aee27a0eac46c.poster.avif?t=1721339108\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843750/extras/67ff580bcaf89795487aee27a0eac46c.webm?t=1721339108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843750/extras/67ff580bcaf89795487aee27a0eac46c.mp4?t=1721339108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arcade Means Powerups</strong></h2>Arm yourself with your trusty blaster and make those voxels explode. Try not to get the ball in your face and get rewarded with <strong>awesome power ups</strong>. Experience the thrill of launching a flaming ball that incinerates everything in its path, unleash a ball of lighting that sends sparks all around or harness the power of the magnet to see all those multipliers fly home and see your scores skyrocket. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843750/extras/7da4666de0544d8b76e868f760005af6.poster.avif?t=1721339108\" width=614 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843750/extras/7da4666de0544d8b76e868f760005af6.webm?t=1721339108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just One More Try</strong></h2>Masternoid features an <strong>intricate scoring system</strong> that values both consistency and rapid reflexes. Hone your voxel blasting skills, collect multipliers, juggle numerous balls, take advantage of the power-ups for maximum impact, and witness your score surge from mere thousands to millions. Engage in friendly competition with your peers and climb the leaderboard ranks like a true arcade legend.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In space no one can hear you dance</strong></h2>Immerse yourself in the synth-driven beats of our <strong>original soundtrack</strong>, a homage to the iconic sounds of the 80s. Experience the <strong>music dynamically shifting with your progress</strong>, unlock new tracks as you venture further into the game and reap the rewards of your journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843750/extras/93c1970f895846d2830403ec1c9ff436.poster.avif?t=1721339108\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843750/extras/93c1970f895846d2830403ec1c9ff436.webp?t=1721339108\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=214 /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There is always a reason to grab your blaster</strong></h2>Whether you are aiming for that elusive final star on a challenging level, looking to surpass your friends in the <strong>leaderboards</strong>, interested in exploring fresh <strong>seasonal levels</strong>, or seizing your daily opportunity in the <strong>Daily Blast</strong>, there's always a compelling reason to put your headset on and immerse yourself in the vibrant voxel world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Game For Everyone</strong></h2>Experience the world of Masternoid anyway you like. Play seated from the comfort of your sofa or standing at the center of your living room. Just relax and get through the voxel world slowly or go for the top of the leaderboards and juggle four balls at the same time. <strong>Either you are 8 or 88, Masternoid has something to offer you.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843750/extras/7a7813bf8d8b271ddbdd36b6570cd678.poster.avif?t=1721339108\" width=614 height=307 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843750/extras/7a7813bf8d8b271ddbdd36b6570cd678.webm?t=1721339108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
